    "en": {
      "name": "Dicemite Gyame Double-Up Chirori",
      "effect": "Roll a six-sided die twice. You can Special Summon 1 LIGHT Attribute monster with a Level equal to or lower than [the total result] from either Graveyard face-up to your field. Then, you can make this card gain ATK equal to [the original ATK of the monster Special Summoned by this effect] until the end of this turn.",
      "official": false
